OL,3,GNEWSAWoman urges people to be aware
OL,4,Aafter brain tumour
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman whose brain tumour was found
OL,7,Ffollowing a routine eye test has urged
OL,8,Fpeople to take notice of changes in
OL,9,Ftheir sight.
OL,11,FLynne Jones, from Reading, knew there
OL,12,Fwas something wrong with her peripheral
OL,13,Fvision and brought a test forward by a
OL,14,Fmonth to get it checked last October.
OL,16,FBut she thought she would be getting
OL,17,Fnew glasses at the town's Specsavers
OL,18,Frather than an immediate hospital
OL,19,Freferral.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
